  <item>
    <title>18 酒后行为大赏！年会时给老板下跪？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6801280bcdd692da1507f87e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6801280bcdd692da1507f87e</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 18 Apr 2025 01:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“火锅即兴剧团”五周年了！五一我们有一系列演出和课程，欢迎搜索“火锅即兴”公众号，加入我们！</span></p><p><em><span>欢迎大家收听「深夜扯犊会」</span></em></p><p><em><span>本期主播：皮盆、小钟、小六、企鹅</span></em></p><p><em><span>皮盆：即兴喜剧演员；小钟：喜剧电影编剧、导演、即兴喜剧演员；小六：喜剧演员、默剧演员、编剧；企鹅：喜剧编剧、演员</span></em></p><p><em><span>本期我们聊一聊与喝酒相关的话题！</span></em></p><p><em><span>在公司年会给老板</span></em><strong><em><span>下跪</span></em></strong><em><span>；毕业被</span></em><strong><em><span>全校</span></em></strong><em><span>学长学姐追着灌酒；在喜欢的</span></em><strong><em><span>女生</span></em></strong><em><span>和她的</span></em><strong><em><span>男友</span></em></strong><em><span>面前极致</span></em><strong><em><span>尴尬</span></em></strong><em><span>的瞬间；和异性</span></em><strong><em><span>嘴对嘴</span></em></strong><em><span>喂酒；喝醉后在</span></em><strong><em><span>洗衣机</span></em></strong><em><span>里被找到；第一次在酒吧被</span></em><strong><em><span>搭讪</span></em></strong><em><span>，结局竟是。。。欢迎收听本期节目。</span></em></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="280">04:40</a> 家人在洗衣机里找到我</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="439">07:19</a> 什么是“气氛酒”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a> 喝醉后英国血脉觉醒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1080">18:00</a> 哥们喝醉后给我女朋友打电话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1478">24:38</a> 在喜欢的女生和她的男友面前极致尴尬的瞬间</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2322">38:42</a> 喝醉后呕吐吐出了“后坐力”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2591">43:11</a> 毕业时被全校追着灌酒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2898">48:18</a> 在公司年会给老板下跪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3125">52:05</a> 宿醉第二天发现，昨晚有人帮我叠衣服</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3360">56:00</a> 跟异性嘴对嘴喂酒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3600">1:00:00</a> 在酒吧被搭讪，最终结局离大谱</span></p><p><em><span>出品：火锅即兴</span></em></p><p><em><span>小红书@</span></em><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/593988396f02d65b1ce013c2?xsec_to