    <title>17 串台｜即兴的喜剧能好笑吗？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67f39499f9578163d6861486</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67f39499f9578163d6861486</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Apr 2025 09:10:47 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期特别节目，作为即兴喜剧剧团串台到了“</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d2a0f50766616acdae635a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d2a0f50766616acdae635a"><span>玲珑塔门市部</span></a><span>”，和相声演员一起聊有关“即兴喜剧”这个小众喜剧形式的方方面面。欢迎收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="253">04:13</a> 什么是即兴喜剧？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="485">08:05</a> 大揭秘！即兴喜剧的套路到底在哪儿？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1181">19:41</a> YES AND！即兴喜剧的基本原则</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1835">30:35</a> SCENE！结束点可以是全场高潮，也可以是最低谷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2376">39:36</a> 即兴喜剧不排练，但训练，都练什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2596">43:16</a> 或许是播客界少有的现场即兴喜剧练习？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3233">53:53</a> 相声是让自己出彩，即兴喜剧是让队友精彩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3414">56:54</a> 过度健身搞砸演出！火锅即兴的滑铁卢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3891">64:51</a> 设定场景在即兴演出中是不是很重要？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4529">75:29</a> 看即兴喜剧的爽点原来是这个！</span></p><span></span><p><span>— — — — — — — —</span></p><span></span><p><span>合作播客：</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d2a0f50766616acdae635a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d2a0f50766616acdae635a"><span>玲珑塔门市部</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>录制场地：CPA中文播客社区-北京三里屯SOHO</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>出品：火锅即兴</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>小红书@</span></em><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/593988396f02d65b1ce013c2?xsec_token=YBplqWCeHw9xPkMXxuXLquJ_bB7K-3dPwOg-l77WlhhXk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593988396f02d65b1ce013c2&amp;apptime=1741754054&amp;share_id=f400db3e000a4d35805a6af1f94e3f01" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/593988396f02d65b1ce013c2?xsec_token=YBplqWCeHw9xPkMXxuXLquJ_bB7K-3dPwOg-l77WlhhXk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593988396f02d65b1ce013c2&amp;apptime=1741754054&amp;share_id=f400db3e000a4d35805a6af1f94e3f01"><em><span>火锅即兴喜剧</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><em><span>B站：火锅即兴喜剧</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>公众号：火锅即兴</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>微信：huoguojixing</span></em></p>]]></description>
