    <description><![CDATA[<p></p><p><em><span>本期主播：皮盆、小钟、小六、企鹅</span></em></p><p><em><span>皮盆：即兴喜剧演员；小钟：喜剧电影编剧、导演、即兴喜剧演员；小六：喜剧演员、默剧演员、编剧；企鹅：喜剧编剧、演员</span></em></p><p><span>本期主播皮盆聊聊他的创业事故，梦想的小店从幻想到现实，再到破灭，许多开店雷区经验分享，以及东北的酒后见闻，欢迎收听！</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="105">01:45</a> 哈尔滨人都是碳烤，我就用电烤</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="262">04:22</a> 夜跑群里遭遇创业合伙人</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 重金购入一辆公交车准备大干一番</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="918">15:18</a> 空降一个店面，竟然还免房租</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1635">27:15</a> 生意爆火后的心态立马变了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2447">40:47</a> 在店里经历的两场恶仗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3253">54:13</a> 烧烤品鉴秘诀</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3546">59:06</a> 北京好吃的烧烤推荐</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-itilNME1ak2KWfqtG3ESzB5qN.JPG"></figure><p><em><span>出品：火锅即兴</span></em></p><p><em><span>小红书@</span></em><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/593988396f02d65b1ce013c2?xsec_token=YBplqWCeHw9xPkMXxuXLquJ_bB7K-3dPwOg-l77WlhhXk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593988396f02d65b1ce013c2&amp;apptime=1741754054&amp;share_id=f400db3e000a4d35805a6af1f94e3f01" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/593988396f02d65b1ce013c2?xsec_token=YBplqWCeHw9xPkMXxuXLquJ_bB7K-3dPwOg-l77WlhhXk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593988396f02d65b1ce013c2&amp;apptime=1741754054&amp;share_id=f400db3e000a4d35805a6af1f94e3f01"><em><span>火锅即兴喜剧</span></em></a></p><p><em><span>B站：火锅即兴喜剧</span></em></p><p><em><span>公众号：火锅即兴</span></em></p><p><em><span>微信：huoguojixing</span></em></p>]]></description>
