  <item>
    <title>14 喜剧用语不完全辞典｜原来每个喜剧演员都有自己的喜剧原理</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67d7e48378103db3bdf04faa</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67d7e48378103db3bdf04faa</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Mar 2025 09:13:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><em><span>欢迎收听本期「深夜扯犊会」</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>本期主播：皮盆、小钟、小六、企鹅</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>皮盆：即兴喜剧演员；小钟：喜剧电影编剧、导演、即兴喜剧演员；小六：喜剧演员、默剧演员、编剧；企鹅：喜剧编剧、演员</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>小红书@</span></em><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/593988396f02d65b1ce013c2?xsec_token=YBplqWCeHw9xPkMXxuXLquJ_bB7K-3dPwOg-l77WlhhXk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593988396f02d65b1ce013c2&amp;apptime=1741754054&amp;share_id=f400db3e000a4d35805a6af1f94e3f01" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/593988396f02d65b1ce013c2?xsec_token=YBplqWCeHw9xPkMXxuXLquJ_bB7K-3dPwOg-l77WlhhXk=&amp;xsec_source=app_share&amp;xhsshare=CopyLink&amp;appuid=593988396f02d65b1ce013c2&amp;apptime=1741754054&amp;share_id=f400db3e000a4d35805a6af1f94e3f01"><em><span>火锅即兴喜剧</span></em></a></p><span></span><p><span>梗、包袱、call back、吐槽这些喜剧常用语都是什么意思；预期违背、反差、反转这些喜剧的技巧如何使用；喜剧的原理究竟是什么？虽然全文充斥着小六的烂梗，但请大家一定听到最后，辛苦了！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="174">02:54</a> “梗”和“包袱”的由来</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="311">05:11</a> “三翻四抖”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="457">07:37</a> “game点”是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="658">10:58</a> 喜剧中的“升级”是什么意思</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> call back的原理是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1025">17:05</a> 即兴展示“打破第四堵墙”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">21:39</a> 张艺谋拍戏的幕后故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1539">25:39</a> 一本正经的胡说八道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1920">32:00</a> 为掉凳和使相正名</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2150">35:50</a> 反转类型电影、小说强力推荐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="time