  <item>
    <title>03 三样法宝，让我从I人到E人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66867d4f0bc5d7cc70d1a506</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66867d4f0bc5d7cc70d1a506</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jul 2024 10:45:35 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>欢迎收听「深夜扯犊会」</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期主播：</span><em><span>皮盆、小钟、小六、企鹅</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>小钟作为一个喜剧人，幽默且自洽。但曾经的他，抑郁、自闭又自卑。是什么经历让他陷入人生谷底？是哪三样东西让他走出了阴霾？小六为什么高考期间睡着了？皮盆高考前十天被表白是什么情况？本期为您揭晓。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="438">07:18</a> 一进复读的学校我就想吐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="504">08:24</a> 同桌的幽默让我对上学有所期待</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="820">13:40</a> 魔术成为拯救我的第二个东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1026">17:06</a> 每天唱“他”的歌治愈我的伤痛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1551">25:51</a> 小时后我见到小朋友没办法说出一句话</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1838">30:38</a> 美女同学给我撑伞竟是为了。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2159">35:59</a> 那一刻我完全释放了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2597">43:17</a> 高考时被误认是同学的父亲</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2705">45:05</a> 高考前十天被表白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2912">48:32</a> 高考前一天去演出，第二天考试睡着了</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuP_5muLGhJlfGjvODBofYY3lwLl.JPG"></figure><span></span><p><span>图片白色衣服 是小钟</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>出品：火锅即兴</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>小红书：火锅即兴喜剧</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>B站：火锅即兴喜剧</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>公众号：火锅即兴</span></em></p><span></span><p><em><span>客服微信：huoguojixing</span></em></p>]]></description>
